  '**The nine positions behind the sheeted scaffold have now been measured.** **I measured fifteen positions on 14 January: the nine at the third level, the two at the second that were obscured in August, and four anchor positions below the second.** **Fourteen of the fifteen read between 12.0 and 12.2 millimetres.**',
