  '**Where the seven came from.** ⚠ **A sentence of that shape tells a reader that there is a question about which cases, and the reader supplies the cases.** **_It is only where the source is named_ offers _but presumably not when the ministry says it_, and seven people went looking for that.** **The amended line offers nothing to look for.**',
  '**The figures.** **Nine queries last year and one since the amendment, which went in on 2 September.** ⚠ **Four months is not a year and two of the four were August and September, when the desks are thin.** **I am claiming only that the amendment is the one change anybody can name.**',
  '**What I did not write, and would not.** **I did not write _at no point may an unnamed claim be reported as fact_.** **That is the same grammar and it reads as though somebody had done it** — **and somebody did, in May, and the note is not the place to say so.**',
