out.push(A('**284 words, both versions quoted, the construction explained in the reader\'s terms with no grammatical word in the letter, a count with the causal claim refused and the thin months named, the rejected version with its reason, and an ask of nothing.** ⚠ **The sentence that earns the band is _and somebody did, in May, and the note is not the place to say so._** **It gives the real reason for rejecting the inversion, admits the incident, and refuses to use the style note to make a point** — **three things in eighteen words.**'));
out.push(S('Stage 7P · Respond (sample slip — band 1)'));
