out.push(S('Stage 7R · Share'));
out.push(A('Two students exchange papers and each reads the other\'s first paragraph against its writer; the room counts the places the voice leaned. ⚠ **Then both read their own as they meant it, and the room says whether the emphasis landed in the same place both times.** **Where it did, the paragraph is finished** — **and that is the only definition of finished this unit offers.** **Then Mrs Ajouz\'s sentence to end on: everything he used against me I had put there on purpose, to help.**'));
